entation:**\u202fHe \u201cis not very willing to further his education,\u201d which points to a limited openness to new learning or feedback.\n**Candidate\u202fD**\n- I have no recorded observations on his crew\u2011cooperation behavior or his communication style. The available notes mention his problem\u2011solving, responsibility, concentration, and that he is considered moody and a loner, but they do not address how he works with or talks to crew members."}
